  "notable_quotes": [
    "atz− ligands bridge Zn(II) into 2D layers, and C2O42− pillars connect these layers into the 3D framework; intramolecular H-bonding further consolidates the structure.",
    "Single-crystal XRD shows compound 1 is a 3D porous pillar-layer framework with 6-connected pcu topology in the monoclinic P21/c space group.",
    "TGA indicates an 8.12% mass loss at 110–145 °C from lattice water removal, after which the framework remains stable up to 347 °C."
